  "english": [
    "<strong>MISHNA:</strong> <b>A woman is acquired</b> by, i.e., becomes betrothed to, a man to be his wife <b>in three ways, and she acquires herself,</b> i.e., she terminates her marriage, <b>in two ways.</b> The mishna elaborates: <b>She is acquired through money, through a document, and through sexual intercourse.</b> With regard to a betrothal <b>through money,</b> there is a dispute between <i>tanna’im</i>: <b>Beit Shammai say</b> that she can be acquired <b>with one dinar or with</b> anything that is <b>worth one dinar. And Beit Hillel say:</b> She can be acquired <b>with one <i>peruta</i>,</b> a small copper coin, <b>or with</b> anything that is <b>worth one <i>peruta</i>.</b> The mishna further clarifies: <b>And how much is</b> the value of <b>one <i>peruta</i>,</b> by the fixed value of silver? The mishna explains that it is <b>one-eighth of the Italian <i>issar</i>,</b> which is a small silver coin.",
    "<b>And</b> a woman <b>acquires herself through a bill of divorce or through the death of the husband. A woman whose husband, who had a brother, died childless [<i>yevama</i></b>], can be <b>acquired</b> by the deceased husband’s brother, the <i>yavam</i>, only <b>through intercourse. And she acquires herself,</b> i.e., she is released from her levirate bond, <b>through <i>ḥalitza</i> or through the death of the <i>yavam</i>.</b>",
    "<strong>GEMARA:</strong> The mishna teaches that <b>a woman</b> can be <b>acquired</b> in three ways. The Gemara asks: <b>What is different here that</b> this mishna <b>teaches: A woman is acquired,</b> using the language of acquisition, <b>and what is different there,</b> in the beginning of the next chapter (42a), <b>which teaches: A man betroths,</b> using the language of betrothal? The Gemara explains: In this mishna the <i>tanna</i> utilized the language of acquisition <b>because he wanted to teach</b> about betrothal through <b>money,</b> which is the standard means of exchange in an act of acquisition.",
    "The Gemara continues its explanation: <b>And from where do we</b> derive that betrothal is accomplished by means of giving <b>money?</b> It is <b>derived</b> by means of a verbal analogy between the term expressing <b>taking</b> stated with regard to betrothal and <b>from</b> the term expressing <b>taking</b> with regard to <b>the field of Ephron.</b> How so? <b>It is written here,</b> with regard to marriage: <b>“When a man takes a woman”</b> (Deuteronomy 24:1), <b>and it is written there,</b> concerning Abraham’s purchase of the field of the Cave of Machpelah from Ephron the Hittite: <b>“I will give money for the field; take it from me”</b> (Genesis 23:13). This verbal analogy teaches that just as Ephron’s field was acquired with money, so too, a woman can be acquired with money.",
    "The Gemara continues: <b>And</b> the <b>taking</b> of Ephron’s field <b>is called an acquisition</b> in the Torah, <b>as it is written</b> with regard to the same issue: <b>“The field which Abraham acquired”</b> (Genesis 25:10)."
  ],
  "gemara": [
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "377px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"0\" data-sentence-id=\"0\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"א\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"0\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><big><strong>הָאִשָּׁה",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "נִקְנֵית</strong></big> בְּשָׁלֹשׁ דְּרָכִים, וְקוֹנָה אֶת עַצְמָהּ בִּשְׁתֵּי",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דְרָכִים. נִקְנֵית <a class=\"mishnah-piska-forward-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-30\" href=\"/kiddushin/2a#gemara-line-3\" title=\"Discussed later in Gemara: Kiddushin 2a\"><span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"0\" data-marker-letter=\"א\">א</span>בְּכֶסֶף</a>, בִּשְׁטָר, וּבְבִיאָה. בְּכֶסֶף:",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"name-reference-marker name-reference-tanna\" data-sage-type=\"tanna\" title=\"Beit Shammai, first and second-generation Tanna\" data-authority-id=\"2756\" data-full-name=\"Beit Shammai\" data-name-he=\"בית שמאי\"><a class=\"mishnah-piska-forward-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-30\" href=\"/kiddushin/2a#gemara-line-3\" title=\"Discussed later in Gemara: Kiddushin 2a\">בֵּית שַׁמַּאי</span> אוֹמְרִים בְּדִינָר</a> וּבְשָׁוֶה דִּינָר, <a class=\"mishnah-piska-forward-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-34\" href=\"/kiddushin/2a#gemara-line-4\" title=\"Discussed later in Gemara: Kiddushin 2a\">וּבֵית</a>",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<a class=\"mishnah-piska-forward-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-34\" href=\"/kiddushin/2a#gemara-line-4\" title=\"Discussed later in Gemara: Kiddushin 2a\">הִלֵּל אוֹמְרִים: בִּפְרוּטָה</a> <span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"1\" data-marker-letter=\"ב\">ב</span>וּבְשָׁוֶה פְּרוּטָה. וְכַמָּה",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"2\" data-marker-letter=\"ג\">ג</span>הִיא פְּרוּטָה – אֶחָד מִשְּׁמֹנָה בָּאִיסָּר הָאִיטַלְקִי.",
      "segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"sentence\" id=\"1\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><a class=\"mishnah-piska-forward-link\" data-piska-quote-group=\"piska-quote-36\" href=\"/kiddushin/2a#gemara-line-7\" title=\"Discussed later in Gemara: Kiddushin 2a\">וְקוֹנָה אֶת עַצְמָהּ בְּגֵט וּבְמִיתַת הַבַּעַל</a>. הַיְּבָמָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "<span class=\"ein_mishpat_marker\" data-ein-mishpat-id=\"3\" data-marker-letter=\"ד\">ד</span>נִקְנֵית בְּבִיאָה, וְקוֹנָה אֶת עַצְמָהּ בַּחֲלִיצָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        1
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "וּבְמִיתַת הַיָּבָם<span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-vilna-piska\" data-sugya-kind=\"vilna-piska\" data-sugya-id=\"0\" data-raw-symbol=\"׃\">׃</span> <span class=\"sugya-marker sugya-marker-steinsaltz\" data-sugya-kind=\"steinsaltz\" data-sugya-id=\"1\" data-sentence-id=\"2\" data-steinsaltz-label=\"ב\"></span> <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"2\" type=\"start\">&star;</span><big><strong>גְּמָ׳</strong></big> הָאִשָּׁה נִקְנֵית. מַאי",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "שְׁנָא הָכָא דְּתָנֵי ״הָאִשָּׁה נִקְנֵית״, וּמַאי שְׁנָא הָתָם",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "דְּתָנֵי ״הָאִישׁ מְקַדֵּשׁ״? מִשּׁוּם דְּקָא בָּעֵי לְמִיתְנֵי",
      "segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "כֶּסֶף, <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"3\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְכֶסֶף מְנָא לַן – גָּמַר ״קִיחָה״ ״קִיחָה״ מִשְּׂדֵה",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "עֶפְרוֹן. כְּתִיב הָכָא: ״כִּי יִקַּח אִישׁ אִשָּׁה״, וּכְתִיב",
      "segment_ids": [
        3
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "הָתָם: ״נָתַתִּי כֶּסֶף הַשָּׂדֶה קַח מִמֶּנִּי״, <span class=\"sentence\" id=\"4\" type=\"start\">&star;</span>וְקִיחָה",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "right": "275px",
      "width": "380px",
      "text": "אִיקְּרִי ״קִנְיָן״, דִּכְתִיב: ״הַשָּׂדֶה אֲשֶׁר קָנָה אַבְרָהָם״.",
      "segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    }
  ],
  "rashi": [
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>הָאִשָּׁה נִקְנֵית.</b> לבעלה: <b>בשלוש</b> <b>דרכים.</b> כדמפרש ואזיל, \"והאי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שלוש לשון נקבה הוא\". ובגמרא בעי אמאי תנא לשון",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "נקבה. וקונה את עצמה בשתי דרכים גרסי': <b>וְקוֹנָה אֶת עַצְמָהּ</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:4",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "להיות ברשותה להינשא לאחר. <b>בְּכֶסֶף, <span class=\"dh-divergent\">ובשטר</span>.</b> מפרש בברייתא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בגמ' (לקמן קידושין דף ה ע\"ב), נותן לה כסף או שווה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כסף, ואומר לה: הרי את מקודשת לי. שטר",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כותב לה על הנייר, אף על פי שאינו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שווה פרוטה, \"הרי את מקודשת לי\". ביאה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בא עליה ואמר: \"התקדשי לי",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "בביאה זו\". וכולהו יליף מקראי. טעמא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:5",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דב\"ש מפרש בגמ' (<a href=\"/kiddushin/11a\">דף יא.</a>). <b>פְּרוּטָה</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:7",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "של נחושת. <b><span class=\"dh-divergent\">איסר</span> הָאִיטַלְקִי</b> של כסף",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:1:8",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ודמיו שמנה פרוטות: <b>הַיְּבָמָה נִקְנֵית</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ליבם. <b>בְּבִיאָה.</b> להיות כאשתו לכל",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "דבר, שאם בא לגרשה אחר כך, אינה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "צריכה הימנו חליצה אלא גט. אבל",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "שטר וכסף אין מועילין בה מן התורה,",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אלא מדרבנן דתקון דמהני בה מאמר,",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "כדאמרינן ביבמות (דף נ ע\"א). אבל אינו",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "גומר בה להיות יורשה ומיטמא לה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ולא לפוטרה מן החליצה, אלא לפוסלה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:2:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "על שאר אחיו. <b>וּמַאי שְׁנָא</b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>הָתָם.</b> בפרק שני (לקמן קידושין דף מא ע\"א) דתנא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "\"האיש מקדש בו ובשלוחו\", ניתני הכא:",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "האשה מתקדשת. <b>מִשּׁוּם <span class=\"dh-divergent\">דקבעי</span></b>",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "<b>לְמִיתְנֵי כֶּסֶף.</b> בהני קניינין, ואמרינן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "לקמן (קידושין דף ד ע\"ב) \"כסף, מנלן דנקנית בו\",",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ומפרשינן דגמרינן \"קיחה\" \"קיחה\" משדה",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "עפרון דאקרי קניין. הלכך תנא הכא",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:3:2",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "קניין. <b>וְכֶסֶף <span class=\"dh-divergent\">מנלן</span>.</b> לאו הכא קא בעי לה,",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "250px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "אלא לקמן (קידושין דף ג ע\"ב). והכא האי מתרץ",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "קאמר לה לכולא מילתא: משום דקא בעי למיתני כסף, וכסף מנלן? ילפינן",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    },
    {
      "width": "450px",
      "right": "0px",
      "left": "",
      "text": "ליה לקמן (קידושין דף ד ע\"ב) מ\"קיחה\", ו\"קיחה\" לשון קניין הוא, הילכך תני האשה נקנית.",
      "source_ref": "Rashi on Kiddushin 2a:4:1",
      "gemara_segment_ids": [
        4
      ]
    }
  ],
  "vilna_piskaot": [
